abstract: "The merchant side of x402 — turn any HTTP endpoint into a paid one. Issue 402 challenges, price SKUs, verify and settle the X-PAYMENT header on Solana and Base, and take a platform fee. Advertise the two main assets — USDC and $THREE — in one challenge."
